   "why": "key says Vallabhaneni Sitamahalakshmi was first woman arrested in Salt Satyagraha in Andhra; notes 214:4:1 / 214:7:3 say Rukmini Lakshmipathi was the first woman arrested in the Salt Satyagraha (214:5:1 lists Sitamahalakshamma only among other CDM women)"
